From a1195bdfd9f831b1ad6725a84d2fb69af38fdbca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Miller <scott@360machineshop.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:07:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix(contour): accept natural endpoint picks on open
 centerlines

Keep the existing climb direction and every automatic move when a start
pick equals the natural centerline endpoint. Refuse interior and opposite
end picks, unproved source offsets, multiple sketch chains and WCS yaw.

Pin both travel directions, leads at each level, source mapping refusals
and the DXF command path without changing goldens or the exit-pick law.
Record the focused item 5 scope and remaining mapping limits.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

